  "name": "fk-proj",
  "description": "fk-proj is an exploratory information design framework aimed at visualizing high-dimensional datasets through non-traditional mapping techniques. It proposes the extension of spatial coordinate systems by integrating visual variables like color, stroke width, and typography as supplemental data axes. The project focuses on bridging the gap between quantitative data representation and expressive, design-centric interface paradigms.",
